<title>JAPAN: Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price at 99.910.</title>
<headline>Japan 3-mth T-bill auction lowest price at 99.910.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Ministry of Finance said its auction of 1.5 trillion yen worth of three-month Treasury bills, or &quot;tankoku&quot;, on Friday produced the following results:</p>
<p> Lowest price     99.910  Stop rate     0.353 pct</p>
<p> Average price    99.910  Average yield 0.352 pct</p>
<p> Total bids	   4.6566 trillion yen</p>
<p> Accepted Bids	1.4997 trillion yen</p>
<p>Bids accepted at lowest price 75.2459 pct</p>
<p> Issue date	 Nov 20, 1996</p>
<p> Maturity	   Feb 20, 1997</p>
</text>
